### A. Extensible Business Model Registry
- **File**: [`BusinessModelRegistry.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/taxonomy/BusinessModelRegistry.ts)
- **19+ Standard Predefined Archetypes**:
  - `BANKING` (Commercial & Retail Banks)
  - `NBFC` (Non-Banking Financial Companies)
  - `HFC` (Housing Finance Companies)
  - `MICROFINANCE` (Joint-liability & MFI lenders)
  - `INSURANCE` (Life & General Underwriters)
  - `ASSET_MANAGEMENT` (AMCs & Wealth Managers)
  - `BROKERAGE` (Retail & Institutional Brokers)
  - `STOCK_EXCHANGE` (Monopoly Market Infrastructure Institutions)
  - `REAL_ESTATE` (Property Developers)
  - `REIT` (Real Estate Investment Trusts)
  - `INVIT` (Infrastructure Investment Trusts)
  - `PROJECT_INFRA` (Heavy EPC & Road Concessions)
  - `UTILITY` (Regulated Return Power & Gas Distribution)
  - `NON_FINANCIAL_OPERATING` (Manufacturing / Consumer / IT)
  - `COMMODITY` (Metals, Mining, Refining)
  - `TELECOM` (Telco operators & Tower infra)
  - `HEALTHCARE` (Hospitals & Diagnostics)
  - `PHARMA` (Formulations, API, CDMO)
  - `DIVERSIFIED` (Holding companies & Conglomerates)
- **Extensible & Safe**: Supports runtime registration of custom models via `registerBusinessModel()`, and fails safely on unknown models without breaking application state.

### B. Sector Taxonomy & Subsector Resolution
- **File**: [`SectorTaxonomyRegistry.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/taxonomy/SectorTaxonomyRegistry.ts)
- Maps 30+ sectors and automatically resolves specialized subsectors to appropriate business models:
  - NBFC → *Housing Finance (HFC)* resolves to `HFC`.
  - NBFC → *Microfinance (MFI)* resolves to `MICROFINANCE`.
  - Financial Services → *Asset Management (AMC)* resolves to `ASSET_MANAGEMENT`.
  - Financial Services → *Stock Exchanges* resolves to `STOCK_EXCHANGE`.

### C. Company Identity Model
- **File**: [`Company.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/models/Company.ts)
- Strict validation across Legal Name, Exchange (`NSE` / `BSE`), Symbol, Sector, Subsector, and Business Model.

### D. Research Project State & Persistence
- **Files**: [`ResearchProject.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/models/ResearchProject.ts), [`ProjectStorage.ts`](file:///c:/Users/Thejas/OneDrive/Desktop/stock%20analyser/src/domain/storage/ProjectStorage.ts)
- Unique collision-resistant ID generation, `localStorage` persistence, duplicate prevention, and clean multi-project switching.

